        "passageText": "MEMO\n\nTo: | All Staff\n\nFrom: A maya Sodhi\n\nSubject: Online Portal\n\nDate: 22 August\n\nThe online portal is now up and running. To use it, patients must first obtain an activation number from a staff member here. Patients will then be able to register to access their records, get lab results, and book appointments. We had also planned to launch a payment option within the portal. However, the Web developers are still dealing with issues with the billing system. As a result, that part of the system will be implemented at a later time.\n\nIt will take some time for all of us to learn how to work with the portal. If you have any questions, please contact Marie at extension 244.",
